flowchart TD
  L[admin login form] --> RL{failures from this IP hash in 15 min: 5 for the user or 20 in total?}
  RL -- yes --> TM[too many]
  RL -- no --> U{account exists?}
  U -- no --> BOOT{no accounts and matches ADMIN_USERNAME and ADMIN_TEMP_PASSWORD?}
  BOOT -- yes --> MK[create owner, must change password]
  BOOT -- no --> DUMMY[burn verify time, record failure] --> INV[invalid]
  U -- yes --> LOCK{locked?}
  LOCK -- yes --> TM
  LOCK -- no --> VER{Argon2id verify}
  VER -- no --> FAIL[count; lock 15 min at 5] --> INV
  VER -- yes --> SES[session token, hash stored, __Host- cookie]
  MK --> SES
  SES --> PW{must change password?}
  PW -- yes --> CH[admin password: policy and HIBP, sign out everywhere]
  PW -- no --> ADM[admin overview]
